     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Shock after acute MI: volume expansion if PAOP is low or normal (15 to 18 mm Hg optimal); w no PA catheter or POCUS: cautious 250 to 500 mL balanced crystalloid boluses, auscultating often for fluid overload."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
